flowchart TD
    U[User input] --> V[1. Validate input]
    V -->|valid send| S[2. Create message and update sender clock]
    S --> Q[(Pending messages)]
    S --> L[(Event log)]
    V -->|valid delivery| D[3. Select pending message]
    D --> F[4. Apply FIFO check if enabled]
    F -->|allowed| C[5. Update receiver Lamport clock]
    C --> L
    F -->|blocked| E[Display FIFO error]
    Q --> D
    L --> O[6. Display event log]
    O --> U
